  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition Support Activity for PLHIV/TB under the Targeted Operational Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide critical nutrition and food support to vulnerable clients living with TB and HIV in South- East Myanmar. The main objective is to improve treatment outcomes for these clients and reduce morbidity and mortality amongst migrants and mobility impacted communities.</narrative>
  </description>
